  "notes": "The passenger scheme (standard.json) with 'CARGO' added to the title and no windows. Measured on 747-400Fs 9V-SFQ (left, March 2026) and 9V-SFI (right, September 2026). Along the tapering tail cone the horizontal gold band covers more of the fuselage's lower side, so it looks broader aft; it is the same band. The 777Fs Singapore Airlines flies for DHL wear DHL's scheme, not this one. Re-checked 2026-11-15: nothing to change; the title has its measured length and every edge is straight.",
  "history": "Added with the cargo divisions (2026-11-13). The 747-400Fs have worn this since delivery (1990s-2000s)."
